  "historyNote": "#6520, eff 5-31-97; ss by #6812, eff 7-23-98; amd by #7179, eff 12-24-99; ss by #7289, eff 6-1-00; ss by #7533, eff 7-24-01; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-99; ss by #7921, eff 7-24-03; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #8084, eff 1-1-05; ss by #8644, eff 6-1-06; ss by #8931, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9163, eff 5-28-08; ss by #9458, eff 4-21-09; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, (various paras (a), (b), & (c)); amd by #9720-B, eff6-5-10, (various paras (a), (b), & (c)); ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14; amd by #10981, eff 1-1-16; ss by #11114, eff 6-3-16; ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25; ss by #14494, eff 1-24-26, EXPIRES: 1-24-36",
